She had been so excited about meeting Kai's Pok\u00e9mon. She smiled gently, trying to hide her feelings.\n\n\"Of course, Kai. Maybe you could show me the Oshawott the next time you see it. I\u2019d love to see more of your Pok\u00e9mon.\"\n\nKai leaned back, his smile genuine now, if not entirely convincing.\n\n\"Thanks, Iolana. That\u2019s really nice of you. I\u2019ll be sure to show you as soon as I can.\"\n\nHe glanced at his phone again, and his expression soured slightly. He turned back to Iolana, and she noticed his eyes reflect the weight of his disappointment.\n\n\"Hey, do you mind if I take this quick call? My dad needs to talk to me.\"\n\n\"Of course not, Kai. Take your time,\" Iolana said, her voice gentle.\n\nKai nodded thanks and stepped away a few feet from Iolana, his voice a mix of gravelly and concerned as he answered the call. Iolana watched him go, her own thoughts turning inward. She took a deep breath, trying to push away the thoughts of Pok\u00e9mon and focus on the present moment.\n\nSwitchConversation\n\nAs I continue, please let me know if you want to explore this scene further, or if you'd like to pivot to a different"}, {"key": [486, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -1.8362668560127025e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.8105081501725442e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [486, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.1973683752587818e-06, "log_surv_s": -1.8977097062627597e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [486, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.0002421911337953208, "log_surv_s": -3.934734372236928e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [486, 3, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -6.736110110146986e-05, "log_surv_s": -2.6211334983581784e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [171, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -7.955941070127957e-05, "log_surv_s": -5.404657263491502e-05, "gen_len": 214, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [171, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.00016538924460221955, "log_sur